# cabin_lit_lanterns: a wall lantern by the door, lit: its ink cap (the
# plate's), its small body lamp light (24), and a single pixel of warm
# spill (28) on the wall above its cap and below its foot. The window's
# frame and the door's casing either side stay dark, so the lamp never
# runs into the lit glass. Placed at at_lantern_l, and flipped at
# at_lantern_r. The anchor, 0,0, is the lantern's cap.
C 24  L -1,1 1,1  L -1,2 1,2  L 0,3
C 28  L 0,-1  L 0,5
